    "q-97589": {
      "dom_id": "step-q97589",
      "name": "Question 16",
      "problem": "$$\nB=\\{[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}],[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]\\},\\,[T]_{B|C}=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 4 \\\\ 8 & 1 \\\\ 7 & 9\\end{aligned}],\\,x=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -6\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nConsider the basis $B$ of ${R}^{2}$ (shown above) and a basis $C$ of ${R}^{3}.$\nThe matrix $[T]_{B|C}$ of the linear map $T:{R}^{2}\\to {R}^{3}$ relative to these bases, and the vector $x\\in {R}^{2},$ are also given. Find $[T(x)]_{C}.$",
      "worked_solution": "We can find the coordinates of the image of $x$ under $T$ relative to the basis $C$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[T(x)]_{C} & =[T]_{B|C}\\cdot [x]_{B}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFirst, we need to find $[x]_{B},$ the coordinates of $x$ relative to $B.$ So, let\n\n$$\nx=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -6\\end{aligned}]={x}_{1}[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}]+{x}_{2}[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nThis gives us the system\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}=1 \\\\ -3{x}_{1}+3{x}_{2}=-6.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe now row-reduce the corresponding augmented matrix using Gaussian elimination, as follows: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ -3 & 3 & -6\\end{aligned}] &  & \\begin{aligned}{R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+3{R}_{1}\\end{aligned} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 3 & -3\\end{aligned}] &  & \\begin{aligned}{R}_{2}:=\\frac{1}{3}{R}_{2}\\end{aligned} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $[x]_{B}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}].$\n\nFinally, we obtain \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[T(x)]_{C} & =[T]_{B|C}\\cdot [x]_{B} \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2 & 4 \\\\ 8 & 1 \\\\ 7 & 9\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 7 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-97589-a",
